@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 1. Verificar salud de API y conexión PostgreSQL + PostGIS
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Iniciar sesión como Monitor (semilla demo)
# @name loginMonitor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "monitor@axiz.demo",
  "password": "Demo123!"
}

### 3. Consultar perfil actual
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Consultar flota en vivo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fleet/live
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Resumen ejecutivo del Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Listar unidades de carga
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/units
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Listar rutas autorizadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Listar geocercas (permitidas y restringidas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/geofences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Listar viajes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Consultar bandeja de alertas abiertas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts?status=New,InReview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
